  "description": "BIZANGO PRO\n\nOur top model in the Mountain Spirit range, the Bizango Pro frame takes all the geometry goodies and functionality from the standard Bizango frame and takes it to another level of performance with a boost 12x148 mm rear dropout and a high performance RockShox fork to elevate the ride quality of the Bizango Pro to levels only seen on much expensive bikes.\n\nThis boost of performance also comes from a 1x12 Shimano Deore transmission, more powerful Shimano hydraulic disc brakes, big volume Maxxis tires and a set of sturdy components and wheels to withstand the harsh conditions of mountain bike riding.\n\nThe Bizango Pro is the most advanced and modern reinterpretation of a bike that has been a part of the Voodoo family for decades. Would you like to join the family?\n\nThe most advanced and capable Spirit; the Bizango Pro raises the bar.",
